Official nand2tetris project vectors, vendored for the HACER conformance oracle.

Source checkout: https://github.com/nand2tetris/web-ide
Pinned commit: 52611ad9bc2a30d329293b0cf58be672d672ac96
Upstream form: TypeScript string modules under projects/src/project_<nn>/*.ts. Each
project's index.ts names the files it ships and the export each is read from; this
tree is that extracted text, not the modules.
Projects included: 01, 02, 03, 04, 05.
Not vendored, although upstream ships them:
- 05/MaxRam.tst: web-ide's own e2e fixture (web-ide #652, MIT), not course material.
- 05/MaxRam.cmp: web-ide's own e2e fixture (web-ide #652, MIT), not course material.
- 05/RAM16K.hdl: web-ide's derived built-in, RAM16K.hdl.replace() over Project 3's stub: not course material, and 03/RAM16K.hdl but for its one new line.

